  "title": "Kissed Golden Polish Tofu Roast",
  "description": "A fatty, light, and energizing Polish dish featuring speculaas spice mix, this roast is perfect for a cold winter night. It is shojin-friendly and made in a wok.",
  "cuisine": "Polish",
